title: "MKCS_V1: Meta-Knowledge Coordination System"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Pitre"
    given-names: "Martin"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-13"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >
  MKCS_V1 is a conceptual Meta-Knowledge Coordination System within the
  MPRD Research Ecosystem. It is designed to coordinate knowledge
  acquisition, learning priorities, uncertainty reduction, exploration,
  and resource allocation using evidence-based uncertainty signals.
keywords:
  - uncertainty
  - knowledge coordination
  - adaptive learning
  - artificial intelligence
  - decision support
  - exploration
  - MPRD
repository-code: "https://github.com/"
